.TH WHISPER-ECHO 1 "August 2026" "whisper-echo 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
whisper\-echo \- real\-time streaming speech\-to\-text with Whisper and VAD
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B whisper\-echo
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B whisper\-echo
provides real\-time streaming speech\-to\-text using OpenAI Whisper and voice activity detection.
It captures audio from the default or specified input device, transcribes speech as it occurs,
and optionally types the transcription via uinput.
A Whisper model file is required for operation. The model path is specified with
.B \-m
or
.B \-\-model
and defaults to
.I ~/.models/ggml-base.en.bin
. If the model cannot be loaded, whisper\-echo will exit with an error. A Silero VAD model
can be specified with
.B \-vm
and is optional but recommended for reliable speech detection.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.TP
.BR \-L ", " \-\-list\-devices
List audio capture devices and exit.
.TP
.BR \-t " N, " \-\-threads " N"
Number of threads to use during computation.
.TP
.BR \-l " LANG, " \-\-language " LANG"
Spoken language, e.g. en.
.TP
.BR \-m " FNAME, " \-\-model " FNAME"
Model path, default ~/.models/ggml-base.en.bin.
.TP
.BR \-c " ID, " \-\-capture " ID"
Capture device ID.
.TP
.BR \-ui ", " \-\-uinput
Type transcribed text via uinput virtual keyboard. Requires manual uinput setup; see docs/uinput.md.
.TP
.BR \-cm " FNAME, " \-\-commands " FNAME"
Voice command configuration file.
.TP
.BR \-ng ", " \-\-no\-gpu
Disable GPU inference.
.TP
.BR \-nsv ", " \-\-no\-silero\-vad
Disable Silero VAD, use energy\-based VAD.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.models/ggml-base.en.bin
Default Whisper model file. A valid model is required for operation.
.TP
.I ~/.models/ggml-silero-v6.2.0.bin
Optional Silero VAD model for neural voice activity detection.
.TP
.I /usr/share/whisper\-echo/command.json
Default voice commands.
.TP
.I /usr/share/whisper\-echo/setup_uinput.sh
Helper script for optional uinput setup. Review before use.
.SH SECURITY
Uinput access allows creation of virtual input devices and can inject keystrokes.
The package does not install udev rules automatically. See docs/uinput.md for manual setup.
.SH SEE ALSO
whisper.cpp(7)
.SH AUTHOR
whisper\-echo contributors
